             </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902558\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/402a/08be/511700_normal.png?m=1692523243\" alt=\"geipen\" data-uid=\"511700\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/geipen\">geipen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 09:06:17 +08:00\">15h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude 订阅的话就要在安卓手机下载一个 claude app ？还是有其它方式</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902850\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/33d0/96b6/278145_normal.png?m=1768055612\" alt=\"tyzrj766\" data-uid=\"278145\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tyzrj766\">tyzrj766</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 11:26:51 +08:00\">12h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在锁区了，后来的没必要整了，而且谷歌开新号容易碰风控封号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902868\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1aea/7787/294351_normal.png?m=1714017470\" alt=\"MoGeJiEr\" data-uid=\"294351\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MoGeJiEr\">MoGeJiEr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-